# UI — build it in tahti-player

The web app is the Tahti Player SPA in `../tahti-player` (`packages/tahti-web`).
Its components come from `@tahti-player/ui` (Storybook) in that repo. New or
changed UI belongs there.

`packages/ui` (`@tahti/ui`) is the component kit of the removed Next.js app.
It stays only because `@tahti/audio-edit`'s plugin `Panel` / `ChainRow`
components import it, and because `scripts/check-design-tokens.sh`,
`check-font-weight-cap.sh` and `check-reference-token-values.sh` read its CSS.

- Do not add new components or routes to `packages/ui`.
- Keep colours in `packages/ui/src/tokens.css` tokens (`pnpm check:tokens`).
